<title>LATVIA: C.BANK SETS UNCHANGED REPO RATES.</title>
<headline>C.BANK SETS UNCHANGED REPO RATES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank has set unchanged rates for its repo auctions which are valid until May 9, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one month repo rate was an unchanged 4.50 percent, the three-month rate was five percent, the six-month rate 5.75 percent and the 12-month repo rate was seven percent, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
